SPOILERS FOLLOW!

When you reach "endgame" you must fight your way through all the
non-friendly monsters - including Liches and the sort.  Some of the
monsters may be friendly, so don't just go randomly blasting all of them
with a Wand of Death (or something like that).  There is a secret door
into each of the rooms that you will need to find.  Eventually you will
find yourself in a maze area that has three exits.  Each of these exits
is into a chapel/temple with an altar.  Find the altar of your alignment
and sacrifice the Amulet of Yendor at it.  With any luck (and I've never
had it happen any other way) you will be promoted to demo-godhood and
the game will be over.  Good Luck
